<title>INDIA: India Ceat Financial 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India Ceat Financial 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     185.6  vs   201.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (in pct)     31    vs    30</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,563.2  vs 1,079.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   589.2  vs   470.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Ceat Financial Services Ltd said in a statement that net profit was lower due to Minimum Alternate Tax payment of 27.5 million rupees against nil in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
